- Normativity, reflection and practical reason: Pollok 2017, Merritt 2018, Kleingeld 2017, Guyer 2016.
- Laws of nature, science and logic: Massimi and Breitenbach 2017, McNulty 2016, Lu-Adler 2018.
- Kant, race, colonialism, gender and animals: Allais 2016, Valdez 2017, Varden 2017, Korsgaard 2018, Mills 2018, Sandford 2018.
